<h1>Install Dekopon</h1>
<div class="hero-buttons">
<a class="button button-primary" href="/deploy/kubernetes/">Deploy on Kubernetes <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
<a class="button button-primary" href="/deploy/mac/">Run on a Mac <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
</div>
<p>Kubernetes is the preferred deployment; the Mac path is for people moving from OpenClaw or Hermes.</p>
<p>Every path runs <code>dekopon-brokerd</code>, which holds policy and provider credentials, and <code>dekopon-gatewayd</code>, which holds chat and model credentials, under separate UIDs joined by one Unix socket.</p>
