<section id="configure">
<h2>The broker runs nothing until you grant it</h2>
<p>Release archives carry no providers, and the image carries only <code>cli-probe</code> and <code>http-probe</code>. Install reviewed providers yourself, or <a href="/providers/">write one</a>. <a href="{{ site.repository }}/tree/main/examples/conditional-write">examples/conditional-write ↗</a> has a complete broker and gateway configuration for one Slack sender.</p>
<p>Set up <a href="/how-it-works/#trace">telemetry collection</a> before you grant the agent useful access: the audit record lives only in the trace.</p>
<p>Check both configurations before you start either daemon: <code>dekopon-brokerd check broker.yaml</code> and <code>dekopon-gatewayd check gatewayd.yaml</code>. Neither check opens the socket or proves a credential works.</p>
